-- =====================================================================
-- Field management example (ECLIPSE group control and economics).
-- SPE1 fluid on a 15 x 15 x 3 grid, two platforms:
--   PLAT-A  PA1-PA3 under group control ('GRUP'), gas injector GI, a
--           group gas limit, a group GOR economic limit (GECON) and a
--           follow-on well PA4 for PA3 (WECON item 9); its wells' THP
--           limits follow the production network (GRUPNET).
--   PLAT-B  PB1-PB2 with own rate limits, prioritised (GCONPRI), and a
--           drilling queue PB3, PB4 (QDRILL) opened when the field
--           cannot meet its oil target.
-- The field sells 10 MMscf/d of gas (GCONSALE) after 2 MMscf/d of fuel
-- (GCONSUMP); the rest is re-injected.
-- =====================================================================
RUNSPEC
TITLE
   Field management: group control, priority, drilling queue, economics, sales gas, network

DIMENS
   15 15 3 /

OIL
WATER
GAS
DISGAS

FIELD

TABDIMS
 1 1 16 12 1 12 /

WELLDIMS
 10 3 3 10 /

START
   1 'JAN' 2020 /

GRID

DX
   675*600 /
DY
   675*600 /
DZ
   225*20 225*30 225*50 /
TOPS
   225*8325 /
PORO
   675*0.3 /
PERMX
   225*500 225*50 225*200 /
PERMY
   225*500 225*50 225*200 /
PERMZ
   225*500 225*50 225*200 /

PROPS

PVTW
   4017.55 1.038 3.22E-6 0.318 0.0 /

